'''November Gauntlet''' (11月強襲！, ''11 Gatsu Kyōshū！'', '''November Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during November and was added in the [[Version 10.10 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Loving Labour (Monthly Event)|Loving Labour]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
The November Gauntlet contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''Labour Lvs''' (労働 Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Labour Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Shard and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[November Gauntlet/Labour Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*November Gauntlet is unlocked after clearing [[Loving Labour (Monthly Event)|Loving Labour]].

